  "body": "Exceptional. Exclusive. Unforgettable.\r\n\r\nA standout 2021 residence delivering 393m² of sophisticated living, spectacular Rangitoto and Hauraki Gulf views, and effortless resort-style luxury across three levels.\r\n\r\nFive bedrooms, four bathrooms, a private penthouse retreat, self-contained apartment, expansive north-facing entertaining, spa, smart-home technology, solar power with Tesla Powerwall, and exceptional parking for up to seven cars.\r\n\r\nSet on a fully fenced 668m² site, moments from Kohimarama Beach, cafés and excellent schools. Offering an exceptional combination of space, security and convenience, with thoughtful smart-home technology designed for effortless modern living.\r\n\r\nThis is one you really need to experience in person - an absolutely stunning home, with the views, scale and quality even more impressive when you step inside.\r\n\r\nA sophisticated, smart and secure coastal home, offering an exceptional lifestyle in one of Auckland’s most sought-after seaside locations. A rare opportunity to secure.",
